    stage2_native_build_codegen_worker_sigabrt_no_diagnostic_2026-11-12, 0, "2026-11-12 OPEN. Run 15 Stage 2 (bfe789dd411, aarch64 cranelift) building the test runner with the RunnerTestDbCore closure added (typed receiver variant e5947985ef7): parse/HIR/MIR clean for 352 modules, then codegen batch 1 dies 'native-build worker terminated with signal 6 before producing a binary' (exit 122), no diagnostic captured; reproduced at bfe789dd411 and 0ceeb3c3421; the 17 added modules build on their own (91-module fixture rc=0). Evidence: doc/08_tracking/bug/stage2_native_build_codegen_worker_sigabrt_no_diagnostic_2026-11-12.md."

